Saving completed! \e
Ability Review #1 \kBy pressing the cursor twice\nin a direction, you can Dash. \e
Ability Review #2 \kUsing the fire button, up to\ntwo fireballs may be shot in\na row.\e
Ability Review #3 \kYou can kick off the wall to\njump higher.\kWhen jumping, jump again as \nsoon as you touch the wall. \kIt can be done with precise \ntiming. \e
Ability Review #4 \kYou can turn into an\ninvincible cloud. \kPress DOWN while jumping to \ntransform.\kAfter transforming you'll \nreturn to normal. \e
Ability Review #4 Part Deux \kYou can pass this gate by \nturning into a cloud. \kPress DOWN during a jump to \ntransform and shoot through \nthe gate. \e
You found Gallery Book #5!\kAfter clearing the game, go to\nOPTIONS to see the extra art! \kThere's 7 volumes in all! \nKeep on searching!\e
